## Every other antimagma of order 4 is one-generated.
gap> ForAll(Difference([1 .. NrSmallAntimagmas(4)], ids), i -> Rank(SmallAntimagma(4, i)) = 1);
true

## Catalogue ids two-generated antimagmas of order 4 with full product set.
gap> Filtered(ids, i -> ProductSetSize(SmallAntimagma(4, i)) = 4);
